WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening, everybody!
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.369
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.770
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.272
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.975
FBI agents reportedly found
a document while searching

00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:12.278
former President Trump's
Mar-A-Lago residence

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.648
that detailed a foreign
country's nuclear capabilities.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.585
Even crazier, it was Luxembourg.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.420
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.322
Former President Obama returned
today to the White House.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:25.525
Oh, God, it must have been
like one of those videos

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.594
where a dog's owner
returns from the war.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:30.663
[ As Obama ] "Joe, Joe!
I'm happy to see you, too.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.532
All right, get down, Joe,
get down."

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.937
[ Normal voice ] Former Trump
strategist Steve Bannon

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.172
is reportedly expected
to turn himself in

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:41.974
to New York state
prosecutors tomorrow

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:44.977
to face a criminal indictment,
and if he's convicted,

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:47.847
he could actually find himself,
for the first time,

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.716
sleeping indoors.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:53.152
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.254
During a White House
coronavirus briefing yesterday,

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:57.690
Dr. Anthony Fauci
said the COVID vaccines

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.593
will likely become annual,
like flu shots or,

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.695
you know, mask-wearing.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.830
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.666
In a new interview,
Hillary Clinton said

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.901
that she started wearing
pantsuits in the '90s

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.271
while she was First Lady
after a Brazilian ad agency

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:16.308
used a photo of her wearing
a skirt in a lingerie campaign.

00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:19.379
And I don't think I need to tell
you who was the first to notice.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.581
"Hey, Hillary,
you're in a magazine!"

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:26.853
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.122
It was reported yesterday that
Pennsylvania Senate candidate

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:33.025
Dr. Mehmet Oz once said
in an interview that incest is

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:36.796
"not a big problem if you're
more than a first cousin away."

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:40.900
Replied the interviewer, "My
question was about tax policy."

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.438
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.441
According to a new survey,
16% of Americans said

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.409
that they share
and track locations

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:51.744
with their friends and family.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:55.048
Though, honestly, a lot of them
do now regret that.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:02:01.888
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:05.257
"Should we check on where
Uncle Tom is?"

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:08.461
Ay-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi!

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.129
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:12.398
returned from the Senate's
August recess yesterday

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:15.235
with his right sling --
right arm in a sling.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.103
But that's also his right sling.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:20.540
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.075
West Virginia Senat--
Oh.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:23.542
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:25.311
Oh, it's coming off the rails.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:31.384
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.753
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin returned

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.621
from the Senate's
August recess yesterday

00:02:35.621 --> 00:02:37.056
with his right arm in a sling.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.993
Well, now we know how Biden
got his climate bill passed.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:45.765
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:48.735
Um, yeah, I think we ordered
this with a neck!

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:51.537
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:53.272
You know, the Biden picture.

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:59.745
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.745 --> 00:03:02.581
Rapper Snoop Dogg has announced
that he's releasing

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:03.850
a new breakfast cereal...

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.450
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.153
...called Snoop Loops.

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:10.923
And if you thought your kids
fought over the prize before...

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:17.063
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.332
"No, it didn't have a prize."

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:23.903
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:27.206
New York's education chancellor,
David Banks, confirmed yesterday

00:03:27.206 --> 00:03:30.209
that public school students will
not get snow days this year.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:34.480
When asked why he said, "'Cause
it's 91 degrees in September."

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.681
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:38.417
And finally,
Target recently issued a recall

00:03:38.417 --> 00:03:40.386
for white fudge animal cookies,

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.655
because they potentially contain
metal wire.

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:46.392
Even worse, apparently,
they also contain white fudge.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.893
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:49.596
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

